## Why This Is Asked
This question tests the ability to build a policy-aware, compliant AI assistant with guardrails and auditable per-tenant controls in Azure. It evaluates understanding of retrieval augmented generation, tenant isolation, risk scoring, and regulatory compliance workflows.

## Key Concepts
- Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG) with Cognitive Search
- Policy-based risk scoring and guardrails
- Tenant isolation via Key Vault and Customer-Managed Keys (CMK)
- PII redaction with Azure AI Text Analytics
- Auditable logging to Azure Data Lake
- Escalation workflow to human reviewers

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo risk score function
function calculateRiskScore(query, policyRules) {
  let riskScore = 0;

  for (const rule of policyRules) {
    if (query.includes(rule.trigger)) {
      riskScore += rule.severity;
    }
  }

  return Math.min(riskScore, 100);
}

// Determine if escalation is needed
function requiresEscalation(score, threshold = 75) {
  return score > threshold;
}
```

